#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:84
msgid ""
"Useful for building histograms of small-integer pixel values without writing"
" a Python loop."
msgstr ""
"Handig om histogrammen van pixelwaarden met kleine gehele getallen te bouwen"
